                    },
                    "authorAssociation": "CONTRIBUTOR",
                    "body": "Looking into plugin specs for mini.nvim I don't think it's lazy loaded, but I also tried to rewrite command so it calls only after mini.nvim is loaded.\r\n```\r\nvim.api.nvim_create_user_command('GitHunksInit', function()\r\n    vim.api.nvim_create_autocmd('User', {\r\n        pattern = 'LazyLoad',\r\n        callback = function(args)\r\n            if args.data == 'mini.nvim' then\r\n                vim.notify '\"mini.nvim\" is loaded'\r\n                vim.api.nvim_input ' gg'\r\n            end\r\n        end,\r\n    })\r\nend, {})\r\n```\r\nbut it doesn't work",
                    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Looking into plugin specs for mini.nvim I don't think it's lazy loaded, but I also tried to rewrite command so it calls only after mini.nvim is loaded.</p>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"vim.api.nvim_create_user_command('GitHunksInit', function()\n    vim.api.nvim_create_autocmd('User', {\n        pattern = 'LazyLoad',\n        callback = function(args)\n            if args.data == 'mini.nvim' then\n                vim.notify '&quot;mini.nvim&quot; is loaded'\n                vim.api.nvim_input ' gg'\n            end\n        end,\n    })\nend, {})\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code class=\"notranslate\">vim.api.nvim_create_user_command('GitHunksInit', function()\n    vim.api.nvim_create_autocmd('User', {\n        pattern = 'LazyLoad',\n        callback = function(args)\n            if args.data == 'mini.nvim' then\n                vim.notify '\"mini.nvim\" is loaded'\n                vim.api.nvim_input ' gg'\n            end\n        end,\n    })\nend, {})\n</code></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">but it doesn't work</p>",
                    "bodyText": "Looking into plugin specs for mini.nvim I don't think it's lazy loaded, but I also tried to rewrite command so it calls only after mini.nvim is loaded.\nvim.api.nvim_create_user_command('GitHunksInit', function()\n    vim.api.nvim_create_autocmd('User', {\n        pattern = 'LazyLoad',\n        callback = function(args)\n            if args.data == 'mini.nvim' then\n                vim.notify '\"mini.nvim\" is loaded'\n                vim.api.nvim_input ' gg'\n            end\n        end,\n    })\nend, {})\n\nbut it doesn't work",
