                    "body": "Sorry, can't help you here. Don't really have experience with 'lazy.nvim' and how to ensure that it loads something in order.\r\n\r\nWith this command approach, the command itself might be *called after* a target 'LazyLoad' event has already triggered.",
                    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Sorry, can't help you here. Don't really have experience with 'lazy.nvim' and how to ensure that it loads something in order.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">With this command approach, the command itself might be <em>called after</em> a target 'LazyLoad' event has already triggered.</p>",
